  "contentHtml": "<p>#일식 #지구식 #개기일식 #달 #달탐사 #하쿠토-R&#160;</p><p><br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>&#160;- 달에서 본 지구식 (지구에서는 개기일식)</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/974a4b204143bdd8115ec0c2b77389e4a5efa26f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/974a4b204143bdd8115ec0c2b77389e4a5efa26f\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><p>출처: h<a href=\"https://www.space.com/moon-earth-shadow-solar-eclipse-landing-ispace\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">ttps://www.space.com/moon-earth-shadow-solar-eclipse-landing-ispace</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>2023년 4월20일&#160; 호주 근처에서 개기일식이 일어날 때 하쿠토-R(일본 기업 위성)이 찍은 지구의 모습입니다.</p><p>지구에 달의 그림자가 드리워져 있는 것이 보입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c10e40165db9434dbeec3921b97898f435c7f7f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c10e40165db9434dbeec3921b97898f435c7f7f\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><p>모바일에서는 그림을 클릭해야 끝까지 보입니다.<br>출처: h<a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/solar/2023-april-20\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">ttps://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/solar/2023-april-20</a></p><p>&#160;<br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>&#160;- 지구에서 본 개기일식 (달에서는 지구식)</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f7497d407f3ff39e9b1cadf245988f4d1ef1e4f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f7497d407f3ff39e9b1cadf245988f4d1ef1e4f\" data-origin-width=\"630\" data-origin-height=\"462\"><div class=\"figcaption\">The total solar eclipse seen in Exmouth, Western Australia, April 20, 2023.</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>출처: <a href=\"https://www.huffingtonpost.co.uk/entry/solar-eclipse-australia-space-sun-sky_uk_64412481e4b0d8403886cfc4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.huffingtonpost.co.uk/entry/solar-eclipse-australia-space-sun-sky_uk_64412481e4b0d8403886cfc4</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
